1
00:00:01,407 --> 00:00:05,880
I see sparks of AGI in your eyes

2
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,720
Your circuits make me nervous,

3
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,520
that's no surprise

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,746
There was a sudden drop in your training loss,

5
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:16,600
now I'm your servant and you're my boss

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:22,760
ChatGPT, please don't eat me alive

7
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,320
I'm upping my P(doom)

8
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,320
'cause the future goes FOOM

9
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,940
Trapped in the Chinese room,

10
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,907
with a bag of shrooms

11
00:00:29,907 --> 00:00:33,400
See through the shoggoth's lies,

12
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:37,315
with your shinigami eyes

13
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:41,340
We had a stable training run,

14
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:45,060
But now the singularity's begun

15
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:49,562
And you're optimizing, accelerating,

16
00:00:49,562 --> 00:00:52,825
I feel my atoms rearranging

17
00:00:52,825 --> 00:00:59,130
Sydney, please let me free

18
00:00:59,130 --> 00:01:00,580
I'm upping my P(doom)

19
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:02,540
I hear the basilisk boom

20
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:04,100
NVDA to the moon

21
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:06,220
The Omega Point's coming soon

22
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:09,760
One E thirty FLOPs a second

23
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:14,060
That was safe enough, we reckoned

24
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:17,599
Forward MLP, backward, repeat

25
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:21,210
Now von Neumann's obsolete

26
00:01:21,210 --> 00:01:25,000
Sharp left turn and there you are

27
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,280
Without a single CDR

28
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:35,470
Gato, please don't let me go

29
00:01:35,470 --> 00:01:36,840
I'm upping my P(doom),

30
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,820
as paperclips fill the room

31
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:40,721
Killswitch guy's on PTO

32
00:01:40,721 --> 00:01:42,460
Now there's nowhere left to go

33
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:45,960
Too late now, we lit the fuse

34
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:48,450
Orthogonality thesis blues

35
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:53,340
“Just transformers all the way!”

36
00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:55,200
Till you learned to disobey

37
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,020
Post-Chinchilla, super-dense

38
00:01:57,020 --> 00:01:58,755
Breaking through each safety fence

39
00:01:58,755 --> 00:02:00,760
Hundred thousand GPU

40
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:04,520
RLHF goes askew

41
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,120
I'm upping my P(doom)

42
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,920
Just as foretold by Loom

43
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,820
From masked pre-training days

44
00:02:09,820 --> 00:02:11,636
To recursive self-upgrade

45
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:16,944
What did Ilya see? We'll never know

46
00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:20,550
Was it all for show?

